00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:32.430
A man carried a woman

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:33.840
into the underground pipes.

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:36.600
Reported the day after Zou Yue vanished.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.520
We should check the scene ourselves.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.030
Let's go. I'll drive.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:43.750
I'll drive. I'm not tired.

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:52.390
This is where I saw them.

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:57.960
There were no streetlights.

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:00.320
It was too dark to see, right?

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:00.880
Right.

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:03.150
When you made the report,

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.760
