00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:09.560
Because the person looked

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:11.590
really small and thin.

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:13.200
So I figured it was a woman.

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:15.400
Or maybe

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.870
a very small, thin man.

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:19.200
Anything else about their appearance?

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:21.430
What they were wearing?

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:23.070
Their hairstyle?

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:24.760
It was too dark.

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:25.760
I couldn't tell.

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:27.310
The hair...

00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:30.040
I think it was long.

00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:31.150
How long?

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:33.560
About...

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:35.150
About here.

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:36.280
Man or woman,

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:37.230
either could.

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:38.760
Otherwise I wouldn't have

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:40.350
had trouble telling, right?

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:18.500
=Ren Yu=

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:20.760
(Adapted from Lei Mi's novel Ren Yu)

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:23.770
=Episode 11=

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:28.960
Then if he's right,

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:30.870
that person wasn't Zou Yue.

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:33.470
Zou Yue had waist-length hair.

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:38.560
We have no leads on Zou Yue.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:41.000
Without evidence linking the cases,

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:43.280
or a person or body,

00:03:44.560 --> 00:03:46.000
