00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:49.280
Who was dragged into those tunnels?

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:52.000
And who took her down there?

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.800
The serial killer

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:00.710
