00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:14.470
at the same spot in the storm drain.

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:18.480
The person dragged underground

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:21.160
could be another victim.

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:23.240
Send more units.

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:24.720
Search this drain now.

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:30.190
